{"date": "2016-08-07", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2016/0807.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:15:53+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "f014cf2027016c7f44db414f9fdb431baa8e333357bca7c0428a1ade8e39a1ca", "image_bytes": 70701, "last_modified": "Tue, 06 Sep 2016 13:08:16 GMT", "title": "宜随风而去", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "岁月、搁浅", "author": "贝尔托·布莱希特", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "每当我夜间饮酒，我常常瞧见她的面容在风中。强风朝我吹来，我向风深深地鞠了一躬。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "BERTOLT BRECHT"}
